     "ask": "Is any shoe alone?",
     "repair": "Yes: one."
    },
    {
     "code": "MATH.G1.NUMBER.PRE_NUMBER_ACTIVITIES.MATCH_OBJECTS.M_MATCH_CANNOT_SAY_WHY",
